{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/9/6d9aaa5b04d121610fa5bfb93c78a7b9ab1176d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^9 - x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> is factored as completely as possible into polynomials and monomials with real integral coefficients, the number of factors is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/a/62a4cb3a1f6864dbeff9874ac613041c31b6d603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{more than } 5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"431\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Obviously, we can factor out an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> first to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/1/7e122d95e8b18b025bfc0a496da698cb2782336a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(x^8-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"72\" height=\"19\" />.\nNext, we repeatedly factor differences of squares:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71a5be89c8c9837ba82eaad17c15b410d8b34c0e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(x^4+1)(x^4-1)\\]\" width=\"135\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a263179eedcc1e11ca73f64968ea3928fdc72fa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(x^4+1)(x^2+1)(x^2-1)\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/c/70cb7aa001ef9be463423705f51e5f8d399c166b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(x^4+1)(x^2+1)(x+1)(x-1)\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"19\" />\nNone of these 5 factors can be factored further, so the answer is \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56d25725f9968a83914637ecbada437cf0b471f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1962 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1962\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>Problem 8</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> 